        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(ui): keep event payload previews UTF-16 safe",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where users viewing the Overview event log would see a broken payload preview when the 120-character preview boundary landed inside an emoji or other UTF-16 surrogate pair.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe Overview preview now uses a shared event payload preview formatter that keeps the existing 120 UTF-16 code unit budget but backs off when the boundary would split a surrogate pair. This is limited to the Overview preview; full debug payload rendering, payload data, API/schema, and event storage are unchanged.\n\n## User Impact\n\nOverview event payload previews remain bounded and no longer display malformed emoji or replacement characters for event payloads containing astral Unicode characters near the preview boundary.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Pre-submit guard: latest `origin/main` at `b23fdcfac953d80b2e7d29bcf311e7f64b45ab7b` still used `formatEventPayload(entry.payload).slice(0, 120)` in `ui/src/pages/overview/event-log.ts`; open PR searches for `formatEventPayload slice`, `UTF-16 payload preview`, and `event-log payload` returned no matching open PRs.\n- Browser issue-path proof: Vite Control UI in Chromium on `/overview` received a gateway event whose legacy preview ended on high surrogate `55357`; rendered `.ov-event-log-payload` had length `119` and last code unit `97`, so it did not end with a dangling surrogate.\n\n```text\n{\n  \"browserUrl\": \"http://127.0.0.1:44315/overview\",\n  \"legacySliceLastCodeUnit\": 55357,\n  \"previewLength\": 119,\n  \"previewLastCodeUnit\": 97,\n  \"previewTail\": \"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\"\n}\n```\n\n- Focused regression test:\n\n```text\nRUN  v4.1.9 [local path redacted]\n\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n     Tests  1 passed (1)\n  Start at  16:34:45\n  Duration  2.39s (transform 359ms, setup 52ms, import 411ms, tests 59ms, environment 1.49s)\n```\n\n- Type and format checks:\n\n```text\n$ node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs -p test/tsconfig/tsconfig.test.ui.json --incremental --tsBuildInfoFile .artifacts/tsgo-cache/test-ui.tsbuildinfo\n```\n\n```text\nChecking formatting...\n\nAll matched files use the correct format.\nFinished in 266ms on 3 files using 8 threads.\n```\n",
